fill__ZPgCR"><video loop="" muted="" playsInline=""></video></span></div><div class="Bento_media2__Z_9Z_" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="AutoplayVideo_video__zckWy AutoplayVideo_fill__ZPgCR"><video loop="" muted="" playsInline=""></video></span></div><div class="Bento_media3__Je_Pc" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="AutoplayVideo_video__zckWy AutoplayVideo_fill__ZPgCR"><video loop="" muted="" playsInline=""></video></span></div><div class="Bento_media4__xfRDt" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="AutoplayVideo_video__zckWy AutoplayVideo_fill__ZPgCR"><video loop="" muted="" playsInline=""></video></span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="Intro_intro__kvY3Y"><div class="container"><div class="Intro_text__1JkoM"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="prose"><h2>Introduction</h2>
<p>Universal Production Partners (UPP) is the VFX powerhouse behind some of Hollywood’s most visually stunning blockbusters, including <em>Barbie (2023)</em>, <em>Blade Runner 2049 (2017)</em>, and <em>Conclave (2024)</em>.</p>
<p>Their work pushes the boundaries of digital effects, crafting immersive, otherworldly visuals that elevate storytelling to an art form. When it came to their website, they needed something brave and equally ambitious—a digital experience that reflected the high-caliber artistry of their work.</p>
<p><!-- notionvc: bca9457c-0e6d-44d3-a047-ec1218303f79 --></p>
</div></span></div><div class="Intro_projectDetails__UWcsm"><div class="Intro_left__d8bha"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div><p class="Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn">Industry</p><p>Film &amp; TV Production</p></div><div><p class="Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn">Location</p><p>Global</p></div></span></div><div class="Intro_right__E3UWy"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div><p class="Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn">Featured by</p><div class="Intro_list__65yay"><a href="https://www.itsnicethat.com/articles/kota-universal-production-partners-website-sponsored-content-240925" target="_blank">It&#x27;s Nice That</a><a href="https://www.awwwards.com/sites/upp" target="_blank">Awwwards</a></div></div></span></div></div><div class="Intro_link__Wrq2r"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><a href="https://www.upp.cz/" target="_blank" style="background-color:#000000;border-color:#000000"><span>Visit site</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 12.6 12.6" class="Intro_buttonArrow___9UE0"><path fill="#fff" d="M11.85 12.6c-.41 0-.75-.34-.75-.75V1.5H.75C.34 1.5 0 1.16 0 .75S.34 0 .75 0h11.1c.41 0 .75.34.75.75v11.1c0 .41-.34.75-.75.75z"></path><path fill="#fff" d="M1.13 12.21c-.19 0-.38-.07-.53-.22a.754.754 0 010-1.06L11.32.22c.29-.29.77-.29 1.06 0 .29.29.29.77 0 1.06L1.66 11.99c-.15.15-.34.22-.53.22z"></path></svg></a></span></div></div></section><section class="ContentBuilder_contentBuilder__FAKQG"><section data-margin="default"><div><section class="Video_video__2erdW"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="false"><div class="Video_videoContainer__21JKT"><div class="Video_loopVideo__1G4By"><span class="AutoplayVideo_video__zckWy AutoplayVideo_fill__ZPgCR"><video loop="" muted="" playsInline=""></video></span></div></div></div></section></div></section><section class="TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy" data-margin="default" data-right-empty="true" style="--brand-color:red"><div class="container"><div class="TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="prose"><h3>A website worthy of Hollywood’s finest</h3>
<p>We wanted UPP’s site to reflect the cinematic depth, artistry, and innovation that define their work. It had to be an <span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="1">immersive, seamless, and boundary-pushing website</span>—one that transports visitors into their world from the moment they land.</p>
<p>Far from a traditional website, it feels like stepping into an immersive corridor. As you navigate, you walk through a digital space filled with beautiful reflections, expansive skies, and cinematic lighting effects that echo the artistry of UPP’s work.</p>
<p><!-- notionvc: 31db7c5b-1164-4e5a-9aba-e2bb4d637880 --></p>
</div></span></div></div></section><section data-margin="default"><div class="container"><div class="SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD"><section class="Video_video__2erdW"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="false"><div class="Video_videoContainer__21JKT"><div class="Video_loopVideo__1G4By"><span class="AutoplayVideo_video__zckWy AutoplayVideo_fill__ZPgCR"><video loop="" muted="" playsInline=""></video></span></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><section class="TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy" data-margin="default" data-right-empty="true" style="--brand-color:red"><div class="container"><div class="TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="prose"><h3>Cinematic storytelling through WebGL</h3>
<p><strong>Pushing the limits of web design</strong></p>
<p>To achieve this, we designed a site that fuses motion, interactivity, and storytelling into a seamless experience.</p>
<ul>
<li>We implemented fluid transitions, 3D effects, and motion-driven interactions that mimic the feeling of stepping into a movie universe.</li>
<li>Dynamic scrolling effects guide users through UPP’s portfolio, bringing their VFX work to life as they navigate.</li>
<li>The homepage unfolds seamlessly, instantly immersing visitors in UPP’s world of visual effects mastery.<br />
<!-- notionvc: ac4e158f-d8aa-4f18-8a0c-1a828e6de751 --></li>
</ul>
<p><!-- notionvc: 57c0407b-f9ed-458e-b86e-f4f57a21d9e0 --></p>
